==English==
===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|kəˈsɛt}}
*{{rhymes|ɛt}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small flat case containing [[magnetic tape]] on two [[reel]]s, used to [[record]] and [[play back]] [[audio]] and [[video]] material.
# Any similar small [[cartridge]], such as for a computer disk.
# {{photography}} A lightproof container for photographic [[film]].
# {{genetics}} A [[modular]] DNA [[sequence]] encoding one or more genes for a single biochemical function.
# {{cycling}} A set of [[sprocket]]s mounted onto a [[splined]] [[shaft]] on the [[freehub]]. 

